Code (src/, notebooks/) in this reproducibility package is provided for the purpose of
reproducing the LDA analysis reported in the associated manuscript ("The Anatomy of a
Phantom: A Socio-Technical Synthesis of AI Code Hallucinations"). You may use, copy, and
modify the code for research and reproducibility purposes with attribution to the manuscript.

Extracted full-text content of the 66 primary studies (data/fulltext_texts/) is derived from
copyrighted third-party publications and is NOT covered by this license. It is retained
locally for internal analysis reproducibility only and must not be redistributed; see
protocol Section 6 ("Do not publicly redistribute copyrighted full text if licensing does not
allow it.").
